  "pdf_review": [
    {
      "page": 1,
      "finding": "The equation displays a replacement character in the carrying term; write (u dot grad)u or typeset the dot."
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "finding": "The roughly 194 peak from the 48 cubed comparison is at printed time 0.1246, while the 64 and 80 cubed endpoints are 0.12. Preserve the actual times when comparing."
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "finding": "Cube-root selected volume does not measure minimum thickness. The 6.6-to-11.6-cell statistic cannot establish that the field is resolved or does not collapse to the grid."
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "finding": "The value 0.0166 is approximately 1/initial_peak. The supplied files do not justify it as an earliest blowup time for this Navier-Stokes flow."
    }
